# Getting Started

Install ggaction and this extension together:

```sh
npm install ggaction {{packageName}}
```

Importing the extension registers its public actions on programs returned by
`chart()`:

```javascript
import { chart } from "ggaction";
import "{{packageName}}";

const program = chart();
```

Continue with a feature tutorial only after that feature appears on the
[Supported Features]({{ '/supported-features/' | relative_url }}) page.
